        "pageid": 82482560,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "The Aquarium Does Not Dance",
        "extract": "The Aquarium Does Not Dance (Japanese: アクアリウムは踊らない, Hepburn: Akuarium-wa-odoranai) is a 2024 adventure horror game by Daidai. The game was solely developed by its developer over eight years. The first part of the game was released in 2019, with the complete version released on 15 February 2024 via various storefronts. An expanded version of the game, with voice acting and extra scenarios, was released on Windows and Nintendo Switch by Gotcha Gotcha Games and Frontier Works in 2025.\n\n",
